WEBVTT

00:19.603 --> 00:24.008
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.008 --> 00:28.646
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.646 --> 00:36.320
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.320 --> 00:41.192
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.192 --> 00:51.936
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:51.936 --> 00:54.071
Mamoritai

00:54.071 --> 00:56.307
Shinjitai

00:56.307 --> 01:00.678
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.678 --> 01:04.982
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:04.982 --> 01:09.253
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.253 --> 01:12.857
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.857 --> 01:21.492
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:31.375 --> 01:34.970
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:35.379 --> 01:37.448
Do you feel hatred?

01:37.448 --> 01:41.214
You were left to die alone
in this desolate place.

01:42.186 --> 01:43.587
But...

01:43.587 --> 01:45.990
the man who caused you
to be in this state...

01:45.990 --> 01:48.618
lives an extravagant
life over there.

01:49.260 --> 01:53.094
Those who lose political battles
usually don't have good endings.

01:53.764 --> 01:56.233
Where is he?

01:56.233 --> 01:59.669
Where is that
wretched man?!

02:01.472 --> 02:04.669
It is Like the Full Moon
to Wane

02:29.600 --> 02:31.500
What are you doing there?

02:31.835 --> 02:33.632
Tell me...

02:33.804 --> 02:36.307
Who is in charge up here?

02:36.307 --> 02:38.639
Who are you?

02:45.983 --> 02:48.816
Tell me who is in
charge up there?

02:49.186 --> 02:51.989
The Counselor of the Right...
of the Fujiwara.

02:51.989 --> 02:54.758
- What's his name?
- Lord Yu-Yukinari!

02:54.758 --> 02:56.827
Lord Fujiwara no Yukinari!

02:56.827 --> 03:00.593
Fujiwara no... Yukinari...

03:23.420 --> 03:25.320
Who's there?

03:26.824 --> 03:28.621
An onryou?!

03:36.166 --> 03:40.437
A full moon slowly
disappears into nothing...

03:40.437 --> 03:44.703
I will take your life...
in the same way...

03:50.748 --> 03:52.511
Mokkun.

03:53.784 --> 03:56.653
I keep wondering
where that onryou went.

03:56.653 --> 03:59.223
We've been to that empty
house so many times,

03:59.223 --> 04:00.891
but it's never appeared again.

04:00.891 --> 04:02.993
It's been on my mind.

04:02.993 --> 04:04.995
Masahiro.

04:04.995 --> 04:07.828
It seems that you're not
focusing on your work.

04:08.365 --> 04:12.636
I'm sorry. I was preoccupied
with my thoughts.

04:12.636 --> 04:15.973
You really need to
catch up on your work.

04:15.973 --> 04:17.804
Toshitsugu, sir.

04:20.544 --> 04:23.447
- Lord Yukinari?!
- Excuse me...

04:23.447 --> 04:25.783
Is Lord Yukinari all right?

04:25.783 --> 04:28.809
It's none of your concern.
Just focus on your work.

04:30.087 --> 04:32.851
That's it? He's not
saying anything else?

04:32.990 --> 04:34.821
Mokkun.

04:35.125 --> 04:38.720
Let's visit Lord Yukinari once
I've completed my work.

04:41.198 --> 04:43.767
- Are you ready?
- Yes!

04:43.767 --> 04:45.669
Are both of you going out?

04:45.669 --> 04:48.972
Yes. We're going
to get some salt...

04:48.972 --> 04:51.475
- Miss Akiko, you're going too?
- Yes.

04:51.475 --> 04:55.546
I'm quite excited as I've never
gone shopping in the city before.

04:55.546 --> 04:58.782
- It'll be quite an experience.
- Oh yes.

04:58.782 --> 05:01.151
- Be careful.
- I will.

05:01.151 --> 05:03.119
We'll be back soon.

05:05.489 --> 05:08.481
I wonder if I should send
someone to follow them.

05:12.062 --> 05:15.793
Well then... which one
should I send?

05:19.002 --> 05:20.492
Right...

05:21.772 --> 05:24.206
Come and have a look!

05:24.675 --> 05:27.244
- Here you go.
- Here's the money.

05:27.244 --> 05:29.079
Thank you!

05:29.079 --> 05:32.483
You can go shopping
on your own now.

05:32.483 --> 05:34.351
Yes, Lady Tsuyuki!

05:34.351 --> 05:37.588
I'm going to have
a look over there.

05:37.588 --> 05:41.258
Feel free to buy anything
that catches your eye.

05:41.258 --> 05:43.089
Thank you!

05:43.460 --> 05:46.623
Welcome to our store!

05:58.575 --> 06:01.203
You're one of
Master Seimei's spirits.

06:04.448 --> 06:08.051
Impressive. Your second sight
surpasses that of Masahiro's.

06:08.051 --> 06:12.890
You're... a shikigami.
What's your name?

06:12.890 --> 06:16.121
I am one of the twelve
shikigami spirits, Rikugou.

06:16.827 --> 06:18.590
Hey, Rikugou...

06:19.329 --> 06:23.667
Would you happen to know
Masahiro's favorite food?

06:23.667 --> 06:26.135
I don't... Why do you ask?

06:26.837 --> 06:30.541
Masahiro... has been
feeling down lately...

06:30.541 --> 06:34.238
So I thought of getting him some
tasty food to cheer him up.

06:34.578 --> 06:36.739
What do you think
he would like?

06:39.316 --> 06:41.652
Dried apricots and peaches.

06:41.652 --> 06:44.644
Right! Thank you.

06:45.622 --> 06:48.557
I really hope that
Masahiro will like them.

06:49.726 --> 06:52.024
Oh, what is that?

06:53.397 --> 06:57.163
- I'm so sorry.
- It's fine. I wasn't paying attention.

07:05.275 --> 07:09.735
- What's the matter?
- The sky... looks different.

07:16.587 --> 07:18.384
This sense is!

07:22.926 --> 07:26.230
- Hey, Kouta!
- Oh, Masahiro!

07:26.230 --> 07:28.765
Is Lord Yukinari in
some kind of trouble?

07:28.765 --> 07:30.634
He fell sick a few days ago,

07:30.634 --> 07:33.737
and his condition has
deteriorated since then.

07:33.737 --> 07:36.106
His distant relative,
an onmyou trainee,

07:36.106 --> 07:39.076
has come to see him
and is seeking a remedy.

07:39.076 --> 07:40.744
I see...

07:40.744 --> 07:43.981
My lord's illness is
caused by an onryou.

07:43.981 --> 07:48.151
So an exorcism ceremony
is now in progress.

07:48.151 --> 07:50.687
If the curse comes
from the west,

07:50.687 --> 07:53.023
may many heavenly days
return with the power of life...

07:53.023 --> 07:54.858
may many heavenly days
return with the power of life...
This voice...

07:54.858 --> 07:55.153
may many heavenly days
return with the power of life...

07:55.792 --> 07:57.761
Extinguish all
confusing entities...
I know it from somewhere...

07:57.761 --> 07:58.386
Extinguish all
confusing entities...

07:58.595 --> 08:00.998
If the curse comes
from the north,

08:00.998 --> 08:02.933
let three fall from
the heavens...

08:02.933 --> 08:03.900
and allow them to return
with the power of life...

08:03.900 --> 08:05.402
and allow them to return
with the power of life...
Excuse me.

08:05.402 --> 08:05.535
and allow them to return
with the power of life...

08:05.535 --> 08:05.569
and allow them to return
with the power of life...
I knew it was him.

08:05.569 --> 08:08.038
Extinguish all
confusing entities...
I knew it was him.

08:08.038 --> 08:08.504
Extinguish all
confusing entities...

08:08.572 --> 08:10.807
If the curse comes
from the center,

08:10.807 --> 08:13.477
let heights fall from
the heavens,

08:13.477 --> 08:16.346
allow them to return with
the power of life.

08:16.346 --> 08:18.548
Extinguish all
confusing entities.

08:18.548 --> 08:20.951
Evil premonitions, I send you
back to your place of origin.
Toshitsugu is incredible.

08:20.951 --> 08:22.886
Evil premonitions, I send you
back to your place of origin.
You really think so?

08:22.886 --> 08:24.354
Evil premonitions, I send you
back to your place of origin.
Isn't it?

08:24.354 --> 08:24.843
Evil premonitions, I send you
back to your place of origin.

08:25.289 --> 08:28.486
You can do a better job
than that.

08:34.598 --> 08:37.226
Lord Yukinari, are you awake?

08:39.436 --> 08:42.132
- Toshitsugu...
- Yes.

08:43.707 --> 08:46.209
- You mustn't get up!
- I'm fine.

08:46.209 --> 08:48.074
Don't worry.

08:50.714 --> 08:52.449
Masahiro!

08:52.449 --> 08:55.543
You came to see me too?

08:56.086 --> 08:59.523
Well... I... That is...

08:59.523 --> 09:02.759
Come, sit down and
make yourself at home.

09:02.759 --> 09:04.522
Thank you.

09:07.364 --> 09:11.562
So, Masahiro, is there
something that you want?

09:12.135 --> 09:15.839
Well, I... I was in
the vicinity...

09:15.839 --> 09:18.208
- So I just dropped by...
- Is that so?

09:18.208 --> 09:20.143
But I'm sure you
can see that...

09:20.143 --> 09:22.679
Lord Yukinari is
rather exhausted.

09:22.679 --> 09:25.282
I think it'd be best
if you leave now.

09:25.282 --> 09:29.586
Lord Yukinari, I've made sure
that no onryou can get near you.

09:29.586 --> 09:31.154
So you can rest easy.

09:31.154 --> 09:34.725
I'll personally perform an
exorcism ceremony soon.

09:34.725 --> 09:37.353
Well, he's pretty
relaxed about it.

09:43.734 --> 09:45.869
What do you want?
A staring match?

09:45.869 --> 09:48.099
Well, bring it on!

09:50.173 --> 09:51.970
I'm here!

09:55.645 --> 09:58.546
- Was it my imagination?
- I win!

09:58.915 --> 10:01.251
I thought I saw
a mononoke just now,

10:01.251 --> 10:04.488
- but I must be mistaken.
- Of course you were.

10:04.488 --> 10:06.590
So, I'll take my leave now.

10:06.590 --> 10:09.150
Thank you for your help,
Toshitsugu.

10:09.760 --> 10:13.697
Masahiro, be sure to turn up
at the dorms tomorrow.

10:13.697 --> 10:15.665
- Yes.
- Don't call me a mononoke!

10:15.665 --> 10:17.467
I'm sorry about that.

10:17.467 --> 10:20.404
I know Toshitsugu's been
picking on you lately.

10:20.404 --> 10:21.894
No...

10:22.272 --> 10:26.009
- He has a misconception.
- A misconception?

10:26.009 --> 10:29.809
Sometime in the middle
of last month...

10:32.315 --> 10:34.851
Toshitsugu returned home
late from the dorms...

10:34.851 --> 10:37.754
as he had to cover the duties
of an errand runner...

10:37.754 --> 10:39.813
who happened to be
absent that day.

10:42.125 --> 10:44.394
But he saw that same
errand runner...

10:44.394 --> 10:47.761
strolling in the capital in
the middle of the night.

10:48.231 --> 10:51.668
I can't believe this.
You're still a trainee,

10:51.668 --> 10:55.263
and you actually skipped work
to visit your girlfriend?

10:55.739 --> 10:57.774
I think you should
know by now...

10:57.774 --> 10:59.969
who that errand runner was.

11:00.544 --> 11:03.911
- It was me, wasn't it?
- Yes.

11:04.681 --> 11:05.482
That guy thinks that
you have a girlfriend?!

11:05.482 --> 11:07.083
That guy thinks that
you have a girlfriend?!
I understand that you were
attending to something important.

11:07.083 --> 11:10.086
I understand that you were
attending to something important.

11:10.086 --> 11:14.090
But I'm not in the position
to let Toshitsugu know.

11:14.090 --> 11:16.626
He's committed to his work.

11:16.626 --> 11:19.796
And because of that,
he cannot tolerate those...

11:19.796 --> 11:22.526
who shy away from
their responsibilities.

11:22.933 --> 11:25.402
If I work doubly hard
from now on,

11:25.402 --> 11:27.904
I think his view of me
will be changed.

11:27.904 --> 11:29.929
I'm so relieved to
hear you say that.

11:34.110 --> 11:36.840
What's this ominous aura?

11:37.848 --> 11:40.339
Do not interfere
in my affairs.

11:44.821 --> 11:46.289
You must be the onryou!

11:46.289 --> 11:49.926
You've made things easier
for me by showing up here.

11:49.926 --> 11:51.127
Meet your doom!

11:51.127 --> 11:53.630
Creature from the
realm of darkness,

11:53.630 --> 11:55.465
return to where
you came from!

11:55.465 --> 11:59.603
Formless arrows, shafts of
deities that break the earth,

11:59.603 --> 12:01.696
unleash and
destroy this spirit!

12:08.144 --> 12:09.839
I did it!

12:28.031 --> 12:29.658
He's here...

12:30.667 --> 12:33.135
Earnestly, earnestly...

12:37.440 --> 12:40.739
What? He just passed you by?

12:44.948 --> 12:46.283
That hurt!

12:46.283 --> 12:49.252
- Mokkun, something's wrong.
- What's wrong?

12:50.020 --> 12:52.352
He actually looked
straight at me!

12:53.557 --> 12:57.118
Toshitsugu never had
the second sight before.

13:10.106 --> 13:13.371
Toshitsugu! What are you
doing here?!

13:17.747 --> 13:19.408
He's being possessed!

13:20.383 --> 13:22.146
Masahiro, get back!

13:23.987 --> 13:25.545
Mokkun!

13:26.089 --> 13:29.752
Within this mortal body, I hereby
raise the shield of the deities!

13:33.129 --> 13:34.619
Masahiro!

13:43.340 --> 13:45.831
- Toshitsugu.
- No!

13:47.777 --> 13:50.746
Run...

13:50.947 --> 13:52.778
Run away...

13:55.885 --> 13:58.655
Hurry up and run away now!

13:58.655 --> 14:02.726
lf... you are hurt...
in any way...

14:02.726 --> 14:05.295
I won't be able to
answer to...

14:05.295 --> 14:08.598
Master Seimei...
or Lord Yoshimasa...

14:08.598 --> 14:11.601
- What are you saying?!
- Hurry!

14:11.601 --> 14:14.900
Hurry... Go!

14:15.472 --> 14:17.235
Toshitsugu!

14:17.807 --> 14:19.468
He's been possessed.

14:20.377 --> 14:22.470
Don't interfere.

14:22.779 --> 14:24.881
I will kill Yukinari.

14:24.881 --> 14:26.783
He was the one...

14:26.783 --> 14:29.486
who framed me and...

14:29.486 --> 14:31.420
exiled me to the edge
of nowhere!

14:54.744 --> 14:57.406
What's the matter, monster?

14:58.481 --> 15:01.450
Won't you stop me?

15:02.052 --> 15:04.612
Aren't you going to
turn me into ashes?

15:06.089 --> 15:07.724
I know...

15:07.724 --> 15:09.759
I know it all...

15:09.759 --> 15:13.797
That your hand is
stained with sins.

15:13.797 --> 15:16.197
Isn't that so?

15:16.933 --> 15:19.502
Oh yes...

15:19.502 --> 15:21.805
You bear the burden
of eternal sin...

15:21.805 --> 15:26.643
Yet, the existence you lead
is free from cares.

15:26.643 --> 15:28.270
His sin...

15:31.581 --> 15:33.276
Guren!

15:44.294 --> 15:46.023
What happened here?

15:46.429 --> 15:48.226
What is going on?

15:48.631 --> 15:50.900
He must have cast a spell
to keep people away.

15:50.900 --> 15:53.136
The forbidden depository's
destroyed!

15:53.136 --> 15:55.572
Masahiro, what exactly
happened?

15:55.572 --> 15:57.707
- Oh, no!
- What is it?

15:57.707 --> 16:00.870
Look! The Cursing Jewel
is gone!

16:02.178 --> 16:05.545
Toshitsugu was actually
possessed by the onryou.

16:06.382 --> 16:09.352
Still, you mustn't put
your life in danger.

16:09.352 --> 16:12.321
Those are just minor injuries.

16:14.023 --> 16:15.820
Father...

16:16.426 --> 16:20.556
I... I'm not a very good
worker, am I?

16:20.997 --> 16:24.134
I mean I take time off
when it's busy...

16:24.134 --> 16:27.437
It's natural that people get
angry when they see me.

16:27.437 --> 16:29.005
What are you saying?

16:29.005 --> 16:33.874
Your grandfather and I know very
well how hard you're working.

16:34.344 --> 16:36.946
I must find Toshitsugu
and save him.

16:36.946 --> 16:39.915
Please grant me a leave of
absence until I've done that!

16:41.851 --> 16:45.981
Well, if you insist, I'll ask the
head of the Onmyou for you.

16:46.723 --> 16:48.156
Thank you, Father!

16:48.892 --> 16:51.053
The Cursing Jewel...

16:51.761 --> 16:55.832
I can't believe they kept that
thing all these years...

16:55.832 --> 16:59.359
What exactly was the head
of the Onmyou thinking?

17:03.173 --> 17:05.300
That Cursing Jewel?

17:06.075 --> 17:08.178
A long time ago, a noble man...

17:08.178 --> 17:11.045
used that same jewel
to curse his enemy.

17:11.314 --> 17:15.648
Because of that incident,
they decided to seal the jewel...

17:16.820 --> 17:19.789
In the end, the truth
was revealed and...

17:19.789 --> 17:22.451
the noble was exiled to Daizafu.

17:23.026 --> 17:29.199
However, I believe that it was
a conspiracy to bring him down.

17:29.199 --> 17:30.689
Really?

17:31.568 --> 17:33.436
Let's see...

17:33.436 --> 17:35.538
I believe... his name was...

17:35.538 --> 17:39.409
Hozumi... no Moronao.

17:39.409 --> 17:41.001
Father.

17:41.778 --> 17:45.441
A messenger from Fujiwara no
Yukinari is asking to see you.

17:48.351 --> 17:50.787
- What?
- I implore you...

17:50.787 --> 17:53.923
Master Seimei,
you must help us!

17:53.923 --> 17:55.481
Kouta?

17:55.859 --> 17:59.062
My lord will surely die
if this goes on.

17:59.062 --> 18:02.098
Young man, please
raise your head.

18:02.098 --> 18:04.434
Kouta. It's you.

18:04.434 --> 18:07.036
- Masahiro.
- What's wrong?

18:07.036 --> 18:08.936
Lord Yukinari...

18:09.806 --> 18:12.798
Lord Yukinari's condition
suddenly deteriorated...

18:13.076 --> 18:15.545
- It can't be...
- Masahiro...

18:15.545 --> 18:18.348
You must hurry to
Lord Yukinari's house.

18:18.348 --> 18:19.838
Yes!

18:29.726 --> 18:31.828
Master Seimei?
Master Seimei?

18:31.828 --> 18:33.930
Where is Master Seimei?

18:33.930 --> 18:35.865
My grandfather sent me
on his behalf.

18:35.865 --> 18:40.169
But why... Why isn't
Master Seimei coming himself?

18:40.169 --> 18:40.503
Why did he send a child
when his life is at stake?

18:40.503 --> 18:43.506
Sagami, stop!
It's not his fault!
Why did he send a child
when his life is at stake?

18:43.506 --> 18:47.243
- Hurry, attend to my lord now!
- Yes.

18:47.243 --> 18:48.232
- Wait!
- Sagami!

19:00.290 --> 19:04.260
I speak not of my own accord,
but on behalf of the deities.

19:04.260 --> 19:06.763
Creature from the
realm of darkness...

19:06.763 --> 19:10.099
The very essence of the
deities rises up to rid you.

19:10.099 --> 19:12.368
Let those who invite
evil spirits...

19:12.368 --> 19:14.928
be punished by the
sword and expelled!

19:20.743 --> 19:23.576
Lord Yukinari? Lord Yukinari?

19:29.185 --> 19:31.454
Masahiro...

19:31.454 --> 19:33.854
Please don't try to get up.

19:35.224 --> 19:37.894
- Masahiro...
- What is it?

19:37.894 --> 19:40.930
- Where is Toshitsugu?
- Um... he's not here today.

19:40.930 --> 19:45.629
Of course, he must be
very busy.

19:46.336 --> 19:48.438
You have to save
your strength...

19:48.438 --> 19:51.374
All preparations for the
exorcism have been made.

19:51.374 --> 19:54.010
Don't worry too much.

19:54.010 --> 19:55.739
Thank you.

20:00.483 --> 20:02.474
It should be happening soon.

20:03.987 --> 20:07.684
Well... we'd better hurry then.

20:11.461 --> 20:13.463
It's a curse.

20:13.463 --> 20:17.333
The onryou that possessed
Toshitsugu must have cast it...

20:17.333 --> 20:19.802
With the Cursing Jewel.

20:19.802 --> 20:21.637
Yes, I know.

20:21.637 --> 20:25.074
The curse can't be stopped
once it has been cast...

20:25.074 --> 20:27.508
until Yukinari dies.

20:28.044 --> 20:31.536
No, there must be
another way.

20:32.749 --> 20:34.851
I'll revoke it.

20:34.851 --> 20:38.014
Toshitsugu will lose his life
if you do that.

20:39.288 --> 20:43.486
You'll have to kill Toshitsugu
to save Yukinari's life.

20:44.093 --> 20:45.928
Are you prepared
to do that?

20:45.928 --> 20:47.830
But what else can I do?!

20:47.830 --> 20:51.766
I want to save both
of them! But...

20:52.969 --> 20:54.459
But...

20:54.837 --> 20:57.240
If that's what you desire...

20:57.240 --> 20:59.742
I'll do my best to
make that happen...

20:59.742 --> 21:01.978
I'll lend you my strength...

21:01.978 --> 21:05.414
After all, that's why...
I am by your side.

21:06.616 --> 21:08.243
Mokkun...

21:09.652 --> 21:13.356
I'll revoke the curse,
protect Lord Yukinari,

21:13.356 --> 21:15.381
and exorcise the onryou...

21:16.926 --> 21:21.764
All right then! Let's wipe that
smirk off Toshitsugu's face...

21:21.764 --> 21:25.131
- Come on, Seimei's grandson!
- Don't call me that!

21:42.819 --> 21:54.230
Toki to shite hito wa dare mo
Yume wo miushinatte shimau

21:54.230 --> 22:05.541
Ayamachi ya kizutsukikata mo
Jidai wa kurikaesarete iku

22:05.541 --> 22:11.280
Doushite shinjiau koto ni aragauno?

22:11.280 --> 22:17.014
Doushite unmei to iu hikari kesuno?

22:19.188 --> 22:29.432
Bokutachi no mirai wa
Kono te de mamori nukitai

22:29.432 --> 22:36.339
Zenryoku de idomukoto no imi wo

22:36.339 --> 22:41.611
Kimi ga oshietekureta kara

22:41.611 --> 22:47.283
Motto motto kimi wa kimi o koete

22:47.283 --> 22:54.519
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.595 --> 23:02.428
Next Episode

23:23.653 --> 23:25.188
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.188 --> 23:26.556
Episode 15.

23:26.556 --> 23:26.622
Release the Catastrophic Chains.

23:26.622 --> 23:29.022
Episode 15
Release the Catastrophic Chains
Release the Catastrophic Chains.
